    ""Text"": ""Presenting the late Nobel Laureate with The Richard C. Holbrooke Award for Social Justice\nOn the anniversary of Elie Wiesel’s birthday, we are so honored to have presented the late Nobel Laureate with The Richard C. Holbrooke Award for Social Justice, given in 2015 by Academy award winner Michael Douglas and author and journalist Kati Marton."",
